The target function is `cJSON_Duplicate`. `cJSON_Duplicate` creates a copy of a `cJSON` item. Use it on an existing item; `recurse=0` duplicates only the node, `recurse=1` duplicates the whole subtree. If `item` is `NULL`, it returns `NULL`. Its signature is as follows:

```c
/* Duplicate a cJSON item */
CJSON_PUBLIC(cJSON *) cJSON_Duplicate(const cJSON *item, cJSON_bool recurse);
```

