    `cJSON_IsInvalid` checks whether a `cJSON` item’s base type is `cJSON_Invalid`. Use it to test an item before other operations. It returns `false` for `NULL`, and `true` only when `(item->type & 0xFF) == cJSON_Invalid`. Its signature is:
    ```c
