5. `cJSON_Minify`
​ `cJSON_Minify` edits a writable JSON string in place to remove whitespace and C-style comments. Use it on a mutable buffer only; `NULL` is ignored. It skips spaces, tabs, CR/LF, `//` and `/* */`, compacting the text.
​ Its signature is:
