1. `cJSON_AddFalseToObject`
​ `cJSON_AddFalseToObject` creates a JSON `false` item and adds it to an object under `name`. Use it for boolean false members. On success it returns the new item; on failure it deletes it and returns `NULL` (e.g., invalid object/name or add failure).
