6. `cJSON_PrintBuffered`
​ `cJSON_PrintBuffered` renders a cJSON tree to text with a preallocated buffer. Use it when you can estimate output size to reduce reallocations. `prebuffer < 0` or alloc failure returns `NULL`; on print failure it frees the buffer and returns `NULL`. `fmt` selects formatted/unformatted output.
