​ ```
3. `cJSON_IsRaw`
​ `cJSON_IsRaw` checks whether a `cJSON` item is a Raw node. Use it to test an item before treating it as raw JSON text. It returns `false` for `NULL`, otherwise `true` only when `(item->type & 0xFF) == cJSON_Raw`.
​ Its signature is:
